//! The DDI estimate's radar's reference table (`relative-profile-v0`,
//! round Z4, `docs/plans/msd-ratings.md`): how each of the eight skills'
//! costs (in points of Accuracy, at a chart's matched level,
//! `ddi_library::manifest::matched_profile`) is spread among charts of
//! similar difficulty, so a skill reads as its percentile among them
//! (`crate::radar::estimate_spokes`).
//!
//! Aggregates only, generated by the coordinating session's study from the
//! maintainer's local library (5,201 original Single charts with a
//! profile, in the estimator's matched-profile domain: to 1,200 source
//! notes without playable mines, 900 with them; `target/scratch/mp/notes/rating-relative-study.rs`, not kept in
//! the repository): for five difficulty bands (their centers
//! [`BAND_CENTERS`]) and every chart together ([`ALL`]), each skill's cost
//! at the percentiles [`KNOT_PCT`] among the charts whose cost for it is
//! over 0.1 points; `None` where fewer than 40 charts had one. No chart's
//! own data is in it. Pasted as generated: regenerate rather than edit.

